Sounds like the problem I had in this thread:
http://groups.google.com/group/rapache/browse_thread/thread/e75ca3e49293ae4b/

The solution is that you have to also install the libapreg2-devel
package, not just libapreg2.

 -Harlan

On Apr 12, 5:00 pm, sheed03 <shee...@gmail.com> wrote:
> Hello, I am trying to install rApache version 1.1.14 on a virtual
