Thank you Jeff, it finally worked and you made my day!!!!

All I needed to do was:
R CMD INSTALL brew_1.0-6.tar.gz  (downloaded from CRAN)

from a command line, then added back the directive in the
configuration file:

<Directory /var/www/brew>
       SetHandler r-script
       RHandler brew::brew
</Directory>

and re-started the apache and all worked.  Now I see brew under
installed and attached packages in my RApacheInfo page.

